[[:db/add "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0" :answer/id #uuid "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0"] [:db/add "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/id #uuid "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc"] [:db/add "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/choices "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0"] [:db/add "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/correct "ae5562fe-2a81-53c6-b681-260e6379d6d0"] [:db/ensure "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/id #uuid "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c"] [:db/add "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 4=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/answer-fields "f32f759b-4ff7-503d-828c-ae04505e7fdc"] [:db/ensure "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "2eaeaf04-a4a9-59d2-b4f7-87b6c47b8d9c"] [:db/add "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892" :answer/id #uuid "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892"] [:db/add "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892" :answer/validate] [:db/add "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/id #uuid "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef"] [:db/add "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/choices "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892"] [:db/add "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/correct "887f20d7-c3bb-5f93-b4e0-13c10c21e892"] [:db/ensure "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/id #uuid "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7"] [:db/add "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/answer-fields "20aeb071-f38e-5388-a548-9dc76bbacdef"] [:db/ensure "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "13285ed5-a0db-5b3a-b640-d68de99074b7"] [:db/add "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d" :answer/id #uuid "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d"] [:db/add "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{6}"] [:db/ensure "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/id #uuid "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758"] [:db/add "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/choices "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d"] [:db/add "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/correct "240331fe-77e6-5e07-bbd7-7c3036a7406d"] [:db/ensure "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/id #uuid "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7"] [:db/add "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{6}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/answer-fields "0564ed71-add6-5e7d-9cef-0e7fccbf5758"] [:db/ensure "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "c0a31a52-2d0e-58b1-8e5c-8873975ed4b7"] [:db/add "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909" :answer/id #uuid "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909"] [:db/add "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777"] [:db/add "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/choices "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909"] [:db/add "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/correct "7681548d-f47c-5759-816e-a74d22459909"] [:db/ensure "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/id #uuid "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708"] [:db/add "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 4=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$"] [:db/add "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/answer-fields "9b441eb5-bd0a-5835-b315-aadb79762777"] [:db/ensure "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "df32ded5-a46c-5912-9f6c-872c8f24c708"] [:db/add "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0" :answer/id #uuid "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0"] [:db/add "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}"] [:db/ensure "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be"] [:db/add "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/choices "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0"] [:db/add "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/correct "eb93ae60-1314-5c1b-8b18-5be2bf67f2c0"] [:db/ensure "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/id #uuid "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a"] [:db/add "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 2=3$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/answer-fields "2e7c9b3d-a38a-5b2d-8d31-027e6df341be"] [:db/ensure "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "c3a16373-f0d4-5113-bf47-986eb7d7132a"] [:db/add "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a" :answer/id #uuid "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a"] [:db/add "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968"] [:db/add "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/choices "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a"] [:db/add "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/correct "a8ec46ef-2302-5566-a10d-87d41945d32a"] [:db/ensure "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/id #uuid "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039"] [:db/add "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/answer-fields "c3a233d5-0ce0-5283-b70a-6b9c2aba4968"] [:db/ensure "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "16b53daa-14dc-5da8-8f94-7fbd5cede039"] [:db/add "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80" :answer/id #uuid "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80"] [:db/add "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349"] [:db/add "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/choices "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80"] [:db/add "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/correct "562b82fb-611f-5664-a991-c0e59c08eb80"] [:db/ensure "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/id #uuid "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927"] [:db/add "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 3=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/answer-fields "f3803484-923b-5b20-a75e-e8453de7a349"] [:db/ensure "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "cf008381-995e-5932-b9bc-a91de5a94927"] [:db/add "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0" :answer/id #uuid "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0"] [:db/add "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70"] [:db/add "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/choices "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0"] [:db/add "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/correct "56a5bbcb-5604-53d6-90b9-661dc62994c0"] [:db/ensure "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/id #uuid "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f"] [:db/add "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{3} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{4}{3}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=3&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{3} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/answer-fields "1a3ae534-c2b7-5e22-a8c5-7585eedc2a70"] [:db/ensure "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "ead967b2-4710-5b6a-baf1-443fc36d1a7f"] [:db/add "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3" :answer/id #uuid "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3"] [:db/add "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/id #uuid "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3"] [:db/add "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/choices "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3"] [:db/add "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/correct "950b070f-afe8-5d89-8e28-5337a676c2c3"] [:db/ensure "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/id #uuid "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce"] [:db/add "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/answer-fields "3475a3fa-ea54-5adb-89d5-92c2bcc0a9f3"] [:db/ensure "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "97f77f4b-3619-56ef-ada9-9d87d6d509ce"] [:db/add "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272" :answer/id #uuid "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272"] [:db/add "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/id #uuid "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142"] [:db/add "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/choices "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272"] [:db/add "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/correct "10477f69-1d94-5ae8-8261-2295242f7272"] [:db/ensure "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/id #uuid "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02"] [:db/add "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{16}\\cdot 4=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$"] [:db/add "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/answer-fields "f0e96963-88a8-54d3-a032-15cf0251d142"] [:db/ensure "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "70c08aac-1499-50fa-94e7-1feee1481f02"] [:db/add "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107" :answer/id #uuid "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107"] [:db/add "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/id #uuid "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8"] [:db/add "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/choices "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107"] [:db/add "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/correct "947dca03-c740-5bcf-8f6a-fdc569b5c107"] [:db/ensure "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/id #uuid "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632"] [:db/add "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{3}{2}}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 3=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{3}{2}}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/answer-fields "6814be85-0e4d-5841-8e09-d898afe2b5f8"] [:db/ensure "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "5a0117c4-51ef-54d2-8f11-754b90a9c632"] [:db/add "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d" :answer/id #uuid "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d"] [:db/add "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1"] [:db/add "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/choices "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d"] [:db/add "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/correct "ce6ab13f-a216-56fc-a883-05600bc1089d"] [:db/ensure "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/id #uuid "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673"] [:db/add "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-3}^{3} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-3&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=3&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-3}^{3} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/answer-fields "e60662bb-f35d-56ab-b75e-dfe60a001cb1"] [:db/ensure "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "1d222a92-2853-555f-98ca-efa744b18673"] [:db/add "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2" :answer/id #uuid "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2"] [:db/add "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2" :answer/value "\\pi"] [:db/ensure "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/id #uuid "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca"] [:db/add "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/choices "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2"] [:db/add "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/correct "f931b18d-a427-5e6c-8717-6fc9f2a68ff2"] [:db/ensure "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/id #uuid "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7"] [:db/add "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 2=3$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\pi.\n$$"] [:db/add "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/answer-fields "64fa45be-734f-5a53-a1f8-46b7f7ba30ca"] [:db/ensure "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "3475a31e-8811-5a04-8514-23df6335e8a7"] [:db/add "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306" :answer/id #uuid "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306"] [:db/add "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306" :answer/validate] [:db/add "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/id #uuid "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f"] [:db/add "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/choices "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306"] [:db/add "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/correct "e290a4ec-1f1d-5c85-bd8a-e94dc7cc4306"] [:db/ensure "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/id #uuid "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b"] [:db/add "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{16}\\cdot 4=\\frac{3}{4}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}.\n$$"] [:db/add "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/answer-fields "59bb2407-e075-51f9-af5b-d3307318152f"] [:db/ensure "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "d2136a2c-75f4-5393-b4ed-03d63d126a6b"] [:db/add "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c" :answer/id #uuid "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c"] [:db/add "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/id #uuid "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a"] [:db/add "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/choices "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c"] [:db/add "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/correct "266c1cae-3692-5924-96cb-117702847d5c"] [:db/ensure "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/id #uuid "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a"] [:db/add "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/answer-fields "80f7df34-3e6d-5955-94fe-963eee69c65a"] [:db/ensure "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "a3d5756b-44e6-5fa5-a82f-9cefb144862a"] [:db/add "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35" :answer/id #uuid "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35"] [:db/add "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/id #uuid "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297"] [:db/add "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/choices "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35"] [:db/add "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/correct "a687e8fa-fa75-5745-809b-113d89674c35"] [:db/ensure "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/id #uuid "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d"] [:db/add "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 2=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/answer-fields "4d88223b-a299-5c5e-a521-c85f03765297"] [:db/ensure "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "6b8136e7-b7a6-53df-a474-fd05c31f363d"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "66ccf1af-0136-5327-b621-8fc066149292"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/83/835b154ff676eb011596bdf6af84feb18bec9eba4027c09e04b284763d6a8842/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186679113 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679117 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679120 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679127 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679136 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679144 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679147 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679149 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679153 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679161 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679168 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679169 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679178 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679180 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679196 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186679198 :question/retired nil true]]
